WEBVTT

NOTE Ekoleddwa ne faster-whisper base.en; ensibuko = vidiyo / Omusingi / Okulaba / VA_NearDIst_220p.mp4; sourceLang=olulimi Oluganda; omulimu=okuwandiika

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.718
Akatambi kano kalaga engeri y’okukebera obusimu n’okugaba endabirwamu.

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:08.020
Naaba mu ngalo tofulumya musulo.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.737
Ojja kwetaaga ekipande ky’okulaba obusimu, ekkalaamu n’ebiwandiiko ebikwata ku bujjanjabi, range

4
00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:17.455
wa endabirwamu z’okusoma n’ekitundu ky’omuguwa ekiwanvu sentimita 40.

5
00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:21.700
Nnyonnyola ky’ogenda okukola mu kufuna okukkiriza.

6
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.475
Omulwadde mutuuze bulungi mu kifo ekirimu omusana omulungi.

7
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:32.551
Kozesa akaguwa okukakasa nti chati ekuumibwa ku bbanga ettuufu erya sentimita 40.

8
00:00:32.551 --> 00:00:37.740
Basabe basome wansi ekipande nga amaaso gombi gakwataganye.

9
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.500
Wandiika layini esinga obutono gye basobola okusoma obulungi.

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Bwe baba tebasobola kusoma layini ya N8, olwo gezaako ne plus 1.5 diopter sphere glasses.

11
00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.376
Bwe baba bakyasobola okusoma N8, olwo kozesa amaanyi agaddako aga waggulu, era bwe kityo

12
00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.860
ku, okutuusa lwe basobola bulungi

13
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.540
soma ekiwandiiko kya N8.

14
00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.660
Kakasa nti egiraasi eri fiddle-k era omulwadde musanyufu n’endabika yaabwe.
